<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-STATISTICS OF KUERTEN V BRUGUERA.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STATISTICS OF KUERTEN V BRUGUERA.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of Sunday's French Open men's singles final between Brazil's Gustavo Kuerten and Spain's Sergi Bruguera (world ranking in brackets):</p>
<p>Kuerten won 6-3 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Time: one hours 50 minutes</p>
<p>				     KUERTEN (66)    BRUGUERA (19)</p>
<p>    Aces				4		    1</p>
<p>    Double faults		   0		    1</p>
<p>    Percentage first serves    82		   58</p>
<p>    Forehand winners	     26		    9</p>
<p>    Backhand winners		6		    4</p>
<p>    Unforced errors		47		   40</p>
<p>    Break points		   18		    9</p>
<p>    Breaks of serve		 6		    1</p>
</text>
